From cd97e00434645b244fb6433be87a1377fc51f6fc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sergio Gonzalez Martin <sergiog@microsoft.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 17:58:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(jpeg): add raw and scanline decoding

Backport of https://github.com/etemesi254/zune-image/pull/441 at
cd97e00434645b244fb6433be87a1377fc51f6fc.

PR 441 is based directly on zune-image dev at
533296caf9a6783691d42b2dfbc623029216cbaf and includes all zune-jpeg changes
merged there, plus the seven raw iMCU and scanline commits in the PR.

Base: zune-jpeg 0.5.16-rc2 from crates.io.
